## Context

`experiments/models.yaml` contains `price_per_mtok_in` and
`price_per_mtok_out` for each cloud model. These drive cost estimates
before sweeps and cost actuals in `RunRecord`. Stale prices cause
budget surprises and inaccurate cost reporting in the paper.

Last committed: 2026-05-03 (header claims 2026-04-25).
Frontier model prices change frequently (DeepSeek, Qwen, Gemini
especially).

## Actions

1. For each cloud model in `models.yaml`, check current pricing on the
   provider or OpenRouter pricing page.
2. Update any entries that have changed by >10%.
3. Flag models that are no longer available or have been superseded.
4. Add a `prices_verified` date comment to the file header.
5. Commit with a log entry noting which prices changed.

## Recurrence

Run this audit before any sweep that has a total budget >$10 USD.
Do not run large sweeps with prices older than 30 days.

## Exit criteria

- All cloud model prices verified against current provider pages.
- `models.yaml` header updated with verification date.
- Any unavailable models flagged or removed.
